  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1530</x>
      <y>160</y>
      <w>370</w>
      <h>60</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Must be thread-safe: the indexing worker embeds
chunks while background threads embed queries.</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>640</x>
      <y>300</y>
      <w>620</w>
      <h>100</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>Adapts an embedding model that runs inside the application's process
(bge-small-en-v1.5, an ONNX model run through LangChain4j) to EmbeddingModel.
The model is inside the library's jar; nativeLibraryFolder is where the
tokenizer's native library is unpacked. The model is loaded on the first embed()
call; if it can't be loaded or can't embed a text, embed() throws EmbeddingException.</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
